WEBVTT

00:06.006 --> 00:08.008
-[bells chime]
-[chalk scrapes]

00:08.091 --> 00:10.135
[rock music plays]

00:17.684 --> 00:19.269
THIS CRACKED ME UP
CHECK IT OUT

00:19.352 --> 00:20.729
POLITICIAN'S SON'S TRUE NATURE

00:22.689 --> 00:24.858
LOOK AT THEM LOL
HIDING BEHIND MONEY. GROSS.

00:24.941 --> 00:26.401
FORCING DRINKS. IS HE FOR REAL?

00:27.152 --> 00:28.278
SERVES THE BULLY RIGHT

00:28.361 --> 00:29.738
NICE ONE, ERPB
TOO MUCH THOUGH?

00:29.821 --> 00:31.156
HUH? I JUST FIND THEM COOL

00:31.239 --> 00:32.407
THEY'RE SO OVER THE TOP!

00:32.490 --> 00:36.411
[man] The ERPB uses corporal punishment,
violating students' rights!

00:36.494 --> 00:39.122
-It must disband!
-[protestors] Disband! Disband!

00:39.205 --> 00:41.916
The ERPB attacks students! It must go!

00:42.000 --> 00:45.462
[protestors] It must go! It must go!

00:45.545 --> 00:47.839
[Hwa-jin] Well, this escalated
more quickly than I expected.

00:47.922 --> 00:49.424
[Gang-seok] It's better like this.

00:49.507 --> 00:51.259
Better to take a beating first.

00:51.342 --> 00:53.845
-[man] Disband!
-Either way, we expected this.

00:53.928 --> 00:55.055
[woman] Disband the ERPB!

00:55.138 --> 00:57.891
Try not to get yourself
caught on video next time.

00:58.391 --> 01:01.936
Hey, weren't you the one who said you'd
block all the bullets that came my way?

01:02.020 --> 01:04.522
Sure, I can block bullets,
but not when there's video evidence.

01:05.106 --> 01:08.651
[clears throat] We'd have to make an
official request to have them taken down.

01:08.735 --> 01:11.946
-Then I just won't do anything at all.
-Hey, that's not what I'm telling you.

01:12.530 --> 01:13.865
Are you doing that on purpose?

01:13.948 --> 01:15.742
-Yes, sir.
-"Yes, sir"?

01:16.534 --> 01:18.828
Back when I had my car,
I should've run you down.

01:18.912 --> 01:22.332
I should've ended you, you brat! God,
sometimes you're worse than a teenager!

01:22.415 --> 01:25.043
-[man] No violence against students!
-You're off the hook. I'm busy.

01:25.126 --> 01:27.128
Oh, of course, sir. Here you go.

01:27.212 --> 01:29.089
[man] The ERPB uses corporal punishment.

01:29.172 --> 01:31.466
You know, there's a whole swarm
of reporters out there.

01:31.549 --> 01:34.803
-You gonna take a beating?
-He who needs a beating should get one.

01:34.886 --> 01:36.471
But that's not us.

01:37.097 --> 01:39.516
[reporter 1] Minister, tell us
what the ERPB actually does.

01:39.599 --> 01:41.684
[reporter 2] You proposed the ERPB
two years ago.

01:41.768 --> 01:43.520
Was it because of the incident
at Jinwon High?

01:43.603 --> 01:45.271
Is corporal punishment the main goal?

01:45.355 --> 01:48.399
How do you reconcile that with the
current laws against corporal punishment?

01:48.483 --> 01:51.361
[reporter 3] Critics are saying
that this model is archaic

01:51.444 --> 01:53.196
and violates students' human rights.

01:53.279 --> 01:55.115
Please give us your thoughts, Minister?

01:56.574 --> 01:57.450
Human rights?

02:00.995 --> 02:02.372
Did you just say human rights?

02:03.581 --> 02:06.626
The Korean education system
has failed its students.

02:06.709 --> 02:10.255
Our children rely on private academies
more than regular school,

02:10.338 --> 02:11.923
and they think of their academy teachers

02:12.006 --> 02:15.009
more like homeroom teachers
with no authority.

02:15.093 --> 02:16.427
Regular schools have become places

02:16.511 --> 02:19.514
that merely fulfill
performance evaluations and quotas.

02:19.597 --> 02:22.809
They extract only what is required
to get into a college. Nothing more.

02:22.892 --> 02:26.146
We also claim that schools are sacred
and important to society,

02:26.229 --> 02:28.940
yet we are seeing gambling,
drug use, statutory rape,

02:29.023 --> 02:32.026
and even violent organized crime groups
occurring there, don't we?

02:32.110 --> 02:35.697
Our children no longer have respect
for their teachers,

02:35.780 --> 02:38.658
and our teachers
are now terrified of their students.

02:38.741 --> 02:40.994
And so, how can we expect
any learning to take place

02:41.077 --> 02:43.121
when teachers have been
stripped of their authority?

02:43.705 --> 02:45.498
Obviously, I'm not referring to children

02:45.582 --> 02:48.418
who have access to academies
and private tutoring.

02:48.501 --> 02:49.836
Of course they're doing just fine.

02:49.919 --> 02:52.088
But there are those
that rely on public schools,

02:52.172 --> 02:54.549
and I want those children
to learn in peace

02:54.632 --> 02:56.801
because that is the system
we built for them.

02:57.510 --> 03:00.930
Therefore, corporal punishment
will be enforced as of now,

03:01.014 --> 03:03.016
and even the harshest forms of it,

03:03.099 --> 03:06.144
if that's what it takes
to protect our children's right to learn.

03:06.895 --> 03:08.897
[rock music plays]

03:11.983 --> 03:14.527
Now I'm talking to you, troublemakers.

03:14.611 --> 03:16.070
Consider this a warning.

03:16.571 --> 03:18.865
Don't interfere with our education system.

03:19.365 --> 03:22.827
Otherwise, the Bureau
will come to put a stop to it.

03:22.911 --> 03:24.078
[music stops]

03:24.162 --> 03:26.289
"FIRM ACTION" DECLARED
AGAINST DISRUPTION TO EDUCATION

03:26.372 --> 03:29.167
[man laughs]

03:29.751 --> 03:32.754
[sighs] We should send
Minister Choi Gang-seok

03:32.837 --> 03:35.298
a token of appreciation
on behalf of the party.

03:35.381 --> 03:38.301
As you know, dear leader, your archrival
Ryu Gwang-pil has been ousted.

03:38.384 --> 03:39.969
It's made our work easier, thanks to him.

03:40.053 --> 03:40.887
HWANG GI-TAE

03:40.970 --> 03:44.933
When was the bill passed to establish
the ERPB? Was it really two years ago?

03:45.016 --> 03:47.435
Yes, they had agreed
to our party's proposed budget increase,

03:47.518 --> 03:49.145
which was for more prosecution activities,

03:49.229 --> 03:51.105
on the condition we accept
their bargaining chip,

03:51.189 --> 03:53.858
which ended up being
the bill to establish the ERPB.

03:53.942 --> 03:58.655
So then, ultimately, the Bureau
was established thanks to us, is that it?

03:58.738 --> 04:00.448
Choi Gang-seok isn't known to the public,

04:00.531 --> 04:02.992
and I'm sure the Bureau will be gone
in no time at all.

04:03.076 --> 04:03.993
Yes, that's right.

04:04.077 --> 04:07.247
Disciplining children by beating them?
You think the public will stand for that?

04:07.330 --> 04:09.832
We ground airplanes on national exam days

04:09.916 --> 04:13.169
so that the listening portions of the test
are heard properly.

04:13.253 --> 04:15.004
When it comes to education,

04:15.088 --> 04:17.465
people don't care
about ideology or party lines.

04:18.716 --> 04:21.761
So educational responsibilities
should fall on that minister.

04:23.346 --> 04:27.684
We need to nip this issue in the bud
quickly in order to avoid future problems.

04:27.767 --> 04:29.769
[tense music plays]

04:33.606 --> 04:35.608
[jaunty music plays]

04:59.340 --> 05:01.384
GUUN HIGH-TECH HIGH SCHOOL

05:01.467 --> 05:03.511
[rock music plays]

05:03.594 --> 05:05.388
RANKED IN THE TOP 3 THUG SCHOOLS

05:05.471 --> 05:06.973
TOP SCHOOL FOR NEXT-GEN GANGSTERS

05:07.056 --> 05:08.599
MOST-AVOIDED SCHOOL BY TEACHERS

05:08.683 --> 05:12.395
TEACH YOU A LESSON

05:14.814 --> 05:16.190
-[boy 1] Move, fucker!
-[groans]

05:17.275 --> 05:18.443
[groans]

05:19.277 --> 05:20.361
Oh!

05:21.738 --> 05:22.697
Whoa!

05:22.780 --> 05:23.698
[yelps]

05:24.949 --> 05:26.075
Fuck you!

05:26.868 --> 05:28.328
[boy 2] Oh, new guy. Damn!

05:28.411 --> 05:30.038
-[boy 3] Got any cigarettes, bro?
-[laughs]

05:30.121 --> 05:32.123
-[boy 3] What the hell do you want?
-[boy 2] Get over here, you bastard.

05:33.541 --> 05:35.251
[boy 4] Were you sitting there before?

05:35.960 --> 05:37.211
[groans] Shit.

05:37.295 --> 05:38.713
[boy 5] I saw it already.

05:38.796 --> 05:40.006
[boy 4] Hey! Fuck!

05:40.089 --> 05:41.382
[boy 7 laughs] He hit him!

05:41.466 --> 05:43.217
[boy 8] No, not yet! It isn't that one!

05:43.301 --> 05:44.385
[boy 9] All right.

05:45.136 --> 05:46.679
[boy 10] Come on, try it out yourselves.

05:46.763 --> 05:49.098
Watch it on YouTube on your own first.

05:49.182 --> 05:50.516
-You, come here!
-[boy 11] Hey!

05:51.267 --> 05:52.435
-Hey!
-Huh?

05:53.436 --> 05:54.437
You looked at me.

05:55.063 --> 05:57.315
-Uh… Uh, no I didn't.
-You did.

05:57.398 --> 05:59.275
Whoa. [gasps]

05:59.359 --> 06:01.444
-You trying to fight or what?
-No, no, I'm not.

06:01.527 --> 06:03.696
-I'm not that kind of student.
-Huh.

06:05.698 --> 06:06.699
-[boy 11] Wait.
-[yelps]

06:06.783 --> 06:08.659
Your uniform's new.
You a transfer student?

06:09.744 --> 06:10.787
Uh-huh.

06:10.870 --> 06:12.663
This school's fucking rough.
Did you know that?

06:12.747 --> 06:16.292
-Oh yes, I already did a bit of research.
-You want protection?

06:18.169 --> 06:19.087
Uh…

06:19.587 --> 06:23.758
I'm not sure you're the kind of guy
I should trust with something so serious.

06:23.841 --> 06:27.345
Why? Because most dudes are all talk
and mostly full of shit? [tuts]

06:27.428 --> 06:30.390
-I'll just have to show you.
-[boy 12 yelps] Protection tax!

06:30.473 --> 06:32.266
[jaunty music plays]

06:37.188 --> 06:40.316
Ah, I can see that you're
an incredibly well-prepared loser.

06:40.400 --> 06:41.859
[sighs]

06:43.486 --> 06:45.488
Oh, do you think, uh,

06:46.864 --> 06:49.700
you could write me out
a little receipt for that?

06:50.201 --> 06:52.203
-Is that a no?
-What the hell do you think, dumbass?

06:52.286 --> 06:53.454
I'm sorry for asking!

06:55.873 --> 06:58.126
-Find the other shoe and wear those.
-[boy 12] Sure.

07:00.378 --> 07:02.004
-[boy 12 sighs]
-[music stops]

07:03.798 --> 07:05.675
[tense music plays]

07:07.009 --> 07:08.136
Hello.

07:08.970 --> 07:11.889
I'm the transfer student.
My name is Bong Geun-dae.

07:13.307 --> 07:14.517
Hello.

07:17.061 --> 07:18.813
Go sit at the desk by the window.

07:21.107 --> 07:22.942
Everyone, try to get along, now.

07:24.652 --> 07:27.488
Books out, guys. Let's start the lesson.

07:28.030 --> 07:29.866
-[Geun-dae] Oh.
-[boy 1] I didn't bring my book.

07:29.949 --> 07:33.035
-[teacher] All right, share.
-[boy 2] I don't have one either.

07:33.119 --> 07:34.954
-[boy 3] Me neither.
-Me too.

07:35.037 --> 07:36.873
[students chuckle]

07:37.582 --> 07:40.168
Then I'll just read aloud,
and that'll be that.

07:40.251 --> 07:41.919
-[foot thuds]
-You'll make us copies.

07:43.629 --> 07:45.506
Could you please, sir?

07:46.924 --> 07:47.800
[gasps]

07:48.801 --> 07:50.595
That'll take way longer.

07:50.678 --> 07:51.971
-[foot thuds]
-[Geun-dae gasps]

07:52.638 --> 07:54.807
[boy 4] All the other teachers do it.

07:57.935 --> 07:59.103
So?

08:00.897 --> 08:03.191
Okay. I'll make some copies.

08:03.691 --> 08:04.692
[boy 4] Thank you.

08:09.280 --> 08:11.449
[door opens, closes]

08:12.450 --> 08:13.826
Guys, let's go farming.

08:14.577 --> 08:17.079
-Wait, what's farming?
-[boy 3] Yeah, farming!

08:17.163 --> 08:18.498
[boy 5] Let's go, guys!

08:19.290 --> 08:20.625
Hurry up. Hurry.

08:20.708 --> 08:23.544
Hey, Gwang-kki, bring
that fucking rat over here.

08:23.628 --> 08:26.339
Huh? Hey, wait.
I'm not part of this. Seriously!

08:26.422 --> 08:27.548
[boy 4] Open it.

08:28.424 --> 08:29.759
[rock music plays]

08:33.971 --> 08:39.852
Hey, guys. For lunch today, we've got
Pikachu on the grill! Ah! Let's go!

08:40.353 --> 08:41.395
[music stops]

08:41.479 --> 08:42.980
[boy 1] You're a design teacher.

08:43.064 --> 08:43.981
[tense music plays]

08:44.065 --> 08:45.358
Draw it on me designer-style.

08:46.067 --> 08:47.276
We're in a class right now.

08:48.069 --> 08:50.738
None of these guys
are even paying attention anyway. Look.

08:50.821 --> 08:52.406
I'm too sleepy for class today.

08:52.490 --> 08:54.617
-Damn it. Let go.
-[students] Ooh!

08:54.700 --> 08:56.285
Let go right now! Ugh!

08:56.369 --> 08:58.371
-[glass smashes]
-[boy 2] Pikachu!

08:59.497 --> 09:00.957
[sighs] Damn it.

09:01.457 --> 09:03.042
Hey, what the hell are you guys doing?

09:03.125 --> 09:05.753
Miss, why don't we have
a group class today?

09:05.836 --> 09:08.923
Ugh. Fuck. Those stupid clunkers. Shit.

09:09.757 --> 09:12.134
Hey, joint class really sounds like fun.

09:12.218 --> 09:13.886
Get the fuck out here, shit-ass.

09:14.845 --> 09:17.014
-Hey, Jik-sae.
-Yeah.

09:17.098 --> 09:20.560
-Get good footage.
-[Jik-sae] I'll make sure you look great.

09:20.643 --> 09:22.478
[students yell]

09:24.689 --> 09:25.565
Oh!

09:29.277 --> 09:31.696
You stupid piece of shit! Ah, fuck!

09:42.456 --> 09:46.168
What the hell, man? I thought
you were gonna film me! You asshole!

09:47.587 --> 09:48.504
Fuck!

09:52.216 --> 09:53.551
[students yell]

09:55.761 --> 09:58.180
[boy] Electrical department attack!

09:58.264 --> 09:59.682
Whoa! Oh!

09:59.765 --> 10:02.727
What the hell are you doing?
You here to fuck around, ass--

10:06.814 --> 10:08.065
[whimpers]

10:08.649 --> 10:10.776
Hey, transfer student!
You here to fuck around?

10:10.860 --> 10:12.028
Uh, no!

10:12.111 --> 10:13.279
Come over here, you little--

10:13.362 --> 10:15.531
What the fuck?
What the hell are you doing?

10:16.032 --> 10:18.075
[Geun-dae] Whoa! [groans]

10:18.159 --> 10:19.410
[groans]

10:20.286 --> 10:23.372
-You were supposed to protect me!
-Oh, you're that fucker from this morning.

10:23.456 --> 10:25.499
-Sorry.
-[Geun-dae groans]

10:26.959 --> 10:28.377
[groans]

10:29.670 --> 10:32.131
You're the transfer student?
I'm Kim Hyeong-ju.

10:32.214 --> 10:33.424
I'm in the same class as you.

10:34.050 --> 10:36.844
Wait, so what the hell is happening?
What are they doing?

10:36.927 --> 10:38.929
-They want to be scouted.
-Huh?

10:40.097 --> 10:42.725
That guy's the leader of the automobile
department. Park Seong-hwan.

10:43.309 --> 10:45.478
-[Geun-dae] The guy with short hair?
-[Hyeong-ju] Yeah.

10:45.561 --> 10:46.896
Uh, see him?

10:46.979 --> 10:48.022
[yells]

10:48.105 --> 10:50.191
He's leader of the electrical department.
Cho In-beom.

10:50.983 --> 10:52.193
[grunts]

10:52.276 --> 10:53.653
-With long hair.
-[Hyeong-ju] Yeah.

10:54.362 --> 10:56.447
You fight well to get noticed,
and win to get scouted.

10:56.530 --> 10:58.699
-[Seong-hwan] Fucker!
-Shut the fuck up, you asshole!

10:59.283 --> 11:01.744
Oh, okay. Who are they getting scouted by?

11:01.827 --> 11:02.953
BULLY HIERARCHY CHART

11:03.037 --> 11:06.832
[man] This kid here, Jang Gwon-hyeok,
is the ultimate leader of the third years.

11:06.916 --> 11:10.127
He shows up at school when he feels
like it, and doesn't come otherwise.

11:10.753 --> 11:13.839
He'll beat up kids
and steal their money all the time,

11:13.923 --> 11:17.093
and he gets into gang fights
with all the schools in the area.

11:17.718 --> 11:19.762
I know I shouldn't say this
as an educator,

11:19.845 --> 11:22.390
but sometimes, I just never want him
to show up again.

11:22.473 --> 11:25.393
Yeah, well, it looks like
he's already half-gangster.

11:25.476 --> 11:28.979
He was scouted even before he graduated,
so he's already living that life.

11:29.063 --> 11:32.108
Look, I'll show you.
Here, take a look at this.

11:33.109 --> 11:36.946
An expensive motorcycle, hard liquor,
designer clothes, tattoos.

11:37.029 --> 11:39.657
And, according to the kids,
there are rumors going around

11:39.740 --> 11:42.493
that he's already earning
tens of millions of won each month.

11:42.576 --> 11:45.162
I get why they're not motivated to study.

11:45.246 --> 11:48.791
They're all killing themselves fighting
so Gwon-hyeok will scout them too.

11:48.874 --> 11:50.084
[jaunty music plays]

11:50.167 --> 11:51.085
[man sighs]

11:53.045 --> 11:54.714
Just fucking die, you bastard!

11:54.797 --> 11:56.132
[groans]

11:56.966 --> 11:58.342
[Seong-hwan groans]

11:58.926 --> 12:02.763
You motherfucker. Your stupid mouth
will always be your weakness.

12:02.847 --> 12:05.433
-Whoa! Hold on, guys! Holy fuck!
-What is it?

12:05.516 --> 12:06.809
-[Jik-sae] Whoa! Fuck!
-What?

12:06.892 --> 12:08.686
Gwon-hyeok sent you a DM! Check it out!

12:08.769 --> 12:10.312
[weapon clatters]

12:11.063 --> 12:12.314
LET'S HAVE AN INTERVIEW

12:13.441 --> 12:15.276
It's Gwon-hyeok! He messaged me!

12:15.985 --> 12:19.363
He wants to have an interview with me,
you fucking asshole. Yes!

12:19.447 --> 12:20.573
[cheering]

12:20.656 --> 12:23.409
-Shit! Fuck! Fuck!
-[In-beom] Whoo!

12:23.492 --> 12:26.287
I'm telling you, our teaching staff
simply can't handle them anymore.

12:26.370 --> 12:29.331
And, um, that's why we contacted the ERPB.

12:29.415 --> 12:30.249
[music stops]

12:30.875 --> 12:33.711
So, when will the other inspectors
from the organization get here?

12:33.794 --> 12:35.838
Should we find a place to set you all up?

12:35.921 --> 12:37.548
Oh, no need. It's just me.

12:38.048 --> 12:39.884
You're gonna handle them
all on your own, then?

12:40.468 --> 12:41.469
I don't want to scare you,

12:41.552 --> 12:44.263
but our last gym teacher
was a former national judo athlete.

12:44.346 --> 12:46.515
He tried to break up a fight
and broke his collarbone.

12:46.599 --> 12:48.100
He hasn't been back to school since.

12:48.184 --> 12:51.812
This is way more than simple discipline.
You need to prepare yourself for war.

12:51.896 --> 12:54.315
Damn! Do you really think
war is necessary?

12:54.398 --> 12:57.651
I'm telling you, with that kind of
laid-back attitude, you're in big trouble.

12:57.735 --> 12:59.904
You should, uh, just look at it
like it's a war, and--

12:59.987 --> 13:02.656
Sir, look. If we go to war…

13:02.740 --> 13:03.699
[inhales]

13:03.783 --> 13:05.034
…then people will die.

13:10.456 --> 13:11.457
[Hwa-jin sighs]

13:11.540 --> 13:13.167
[tense music plays]

13:15.586 --> 13:16.420
[Hwa-jin exhales]

13:16.504 --> 13:17.588
[Hwa-jin sniffs]

13:17.671 --> 13:18.631
[Hwa-jin sighs]

13:20.257 --> 13:21.467
Don't worry about it.

13:21.967 --> 13:25.304
Your students will all get along
and they'll enjoy their classes.

13:26.639 --> 13:29.517
[groaning]

13:30.142 --> 13:31.352
[boy groans]

13:32.311 --> 13:34.021
-[groans]
-[Seong-hwan] Goddamn it.

13:34.104 --> 13:36.357
Blah, blah, blah, blah, blah, blah.

13:36.440 --> 13:38.484
You're a piece of crap, you fucking idiot.

13:38.567 --> 13:42.071
You ran away before, didn't you?
Why'd you come to this school anyway?

13:44.323 --> 13:47.159
I wanted to study cars
and get a job somewhere.

13:47.243 --> 13:49.328
I'm trying to get a job, too, you know.

13:49.411 --> 13:51.580
Gwon-hyeok is his own corporation,

13:52.164 --> 13:54.416
and fist fights are what we get graded on.

14:05.970 --> 14:07.888
AUTOMOTIVE TECHNICIAN
PRACTICAL TEST

14:10.641 --> 14:11.642
Get over here.

14:11.725 --> 14:14.103
Hey! Transfer student, come here.

14:14.186 --> 14:15.437
-[laughter]
-Move your ass!

14:16.021 --> 14:17.064
-Get over there.
-Wait!

14:17.147 --> 14:18.232
What? What did…

14:18.315 --> 14:19.400
You can beat him, right?

14:20.234 --> 14:22.111
-Fight.
-Huh?

14:22.611 --> 14:24.113
The fucker that loses

14:24.613 --> 14:25.698
will become the punch meter.

14:25.781 --> 14:28.659
[laughter]

14:29.159 --> 14:32.079
Uh, do you think I could ask you what…

14:32.913 --> 14:33.873
what is a punch meter?

14:34.665 --> 14:36.333
-You wanna know, hey?
-[laughter]

14:36.417 --> 14:37.293
[Geun-dae] Oh.

14:37.793 --> 14:39.628
-Lose and find out.
-Oh.

14:40.296 --> 14:41.297
Fight.

14:42.673 --> 14:43.674
Oh.

14:44.633 --> 14:46.135
-Want me to kick your ass?
-[whimpers]

14:46.218 --> 14:49.513
What? Wait!
Wh… what are you doing? [pants]

14:49.597 --> 14:51.807
-[indistinct chatter]
-Just hit me.

14:51.891 --> 14:54.310
-Why today? Why are you doing this?
-They always do this.

14:54.393 --> 14:55.769
-Hit me.
-No, I can't!

14:55.853 --> 14:57.730
If you don't,
they'll beat the both of us up.

14:57.813 --> 14:59.356
[grunts]

14:59.440 --> 15:01.108
-[cheering]
-Oh!

15:01.775 --> 15:03.777
-[boy 1] Get him up!
-Are you okay?

15:03.861 --> 15:04.945
-[Seong-hwan grunts]
-Whoa!

15:05.529 --> 15:06.947
-[groans]
-[Seong-hwan] Listen to me.

15:07.031 --> 15:09.783
If Gwon-hyeok doesn't notice us
this time around,

15:09.867 --> 15:11.410
then we're all done for.

15:11.493 --> 15:12.870
-Okay. Got it.
-Punch meter?

15:13.454 --> 15:15.039
[breathes heavily]

15:16.582 --> 15:18.834
[boy 2] Make sure
you measure the distance properly!

15:18.918 --> 15:21.587
-[groans]
-[students] Ooh!

15:22.588 --> 15:24.590
♪ Bada-bada-ba-bam! ♪

15:24.673 --> 15:25.883
You scored 92 points.

15:25.966 --> 15:27.718
Congratulations.
You must be an MMA fighter.

15:27.801 --> 15:29.970
[Seong-hwan] You've improved.
You should fight with them.

15:30.054 --> 15:31.013
[laughter]

15:31.096 --> 15:33.474
[boy 3] How many points do I get?
Move, move.

15:33.557 --> 15:35.100
-[grunting]
-[cheering]

15:35.684 --> 15:38.687
You scored 95 points!
Congrats. You're currently number one!

15:38.771 --> 15:39.855
-[boy 4] Ha!
-[boy 5] Fuck!

15:39.939 --> 15:40.981
[panting]

15:41.065 --> 15:43.400
[laughter fades]

15:43.484 --> 15:45.569
[breathes heavily]

15:46.445 --> 15:48.405
Oh, whoa, whoa, whoa!
Uh, hey, are you okay?

15:48.489 --> 15:49.448
I'm okay.

15:49.531 --> 15:50.574
-Oh.
-Don't worry about it.

15:50.658 --> 15:52.326
-Oh, well, here, just…
-[groans]

15:52.409 --> 15:56.288
Just hold on to this for a sec.
At least let me hold your bag for you.

15:56.372 --> 15:58.123
-It's really all right.
-I want to help.

15:58.916 --> 15:59.875
You helped me today.

16:01.710 --> 16:06.090
-Well, thank you.
-So, where do you… where do you live?

16:06.674 --> 16:08.676
[gentle music plays]

16:09.468 --> 16:10.886
[Hyeong-ju] This is my place.

16:11.553 --> 16:13.097
Oh. Right. Here.

16:13.722 --> 16:15.599
-Thanks a lot.
-See you tomorrow.

16:16.100 --> 16:18.018
Do you want to come inside?

16:19.937 --> 16:22.815
[laughs] I didn't mean it like that!
I meant do you want some ramyeon?

16:22.898 --> 16:25.192
Uh… [laughs awkwardly]

16:25.275 --> 16:26.777
Well…

16:27.528 --> 16:28.570
Okay, sure.

16:28.654 --> 16:30.030
-[Hyeong-ju] Great. Come in.
-Okay.

16:31.115 --> 16:32.908
-Watch your step.
-[Geun-dae] Thanks.

16:32.992 --> 16:34.159
[keys jangle]

16:35.911 --> 16:37.246
[door opens]

16:59.935 --> 17:01.478
-[Geun-dae] Uh… Oh.
-[exhales]

17:01.562 --> 17:02.563
Thank you.

17:03.397 --> 17:05.190
So, why did you come to our school?

17:06.275 --> 17:08.652
For college. Through that, uh, special,

17:08.736 --> 17:10.696
uh, specialized high school stream.

17:11.196 --> 17:13.282
Might as well go to another school, then.

17:14.116 --> 17:16.994
Since you just transferred over,
you'll still have a chance.

17:17.745 --> 17:21.331
It's not too late to tell your parents
and get them to enroll you somewhere else.

17:21.832 --> 17:23.167
Oh, thank you.

17:24.626 --> 17:26.003
What about you?

17:26.545 --> 17:29.214
I always thought this school
was my only option, but it wasn't.

17:29.298 --> 17:31.759
Except that now,
it's too late for me to change.

17:31.842 --> 17:33.927
Well, you could always
take the GED instead.

17:34.011 --> 17:37.097
Yes, but that would cost too much
with private academies and tutoring.

17:46.857 --> 17:48.358
-Try some of the kimchi.
-[Geun-dae] Hm?

17:48.442 --> 17:51.070
My mom works at a restaurant,
and the kimchi's famous, apparently.

17:51.153 --> 17:52.196
Okay.

17:54.740 --> 17:55.783
[door opens]

17:56.492 --> 17:57.659
That's my mom.

17:58.619 --> 18:00.454
[mom] Hyeong-ju, are you home?

18:02.372 --> 18:03.248
Good afternoon.

18:03.332 --> 18:06.460
Oh my! Hyeong-ju,
you brought a friend home!

18:07.836 --> 18:11.757
Wait, all you're eating is ramyeon?
Hang on, I'll make a proper meal for you.

18:12.299 --> 18:14.510
-Oh, I'm okay.
-Mom, we'll eat this, it's okay.

18:15.010 --> 18:17.346
-I must smell pretty bad, don't I?
-No.

18:17.429 --> 18:21.183
I'll… I'll go wash up quickly.
Just give me a minute. [chuckles]

18:21.266 --> 18:22.309
[Hyeong-ju chuckles]

18:23.143 --> 18:24.520
-[door closes]
-[chuckles]

18:27.106 --> 18:29.024
[paper rustles]

18:41.078 --> 18:43.080
[chuckles] If you stuff them like this,

18:43.163 --> 18:45.791
the newspaper picks up all the moisture,
so it dries well.

18:45.874 --> 18:49.711
My mom's shoes stay wet all day long
so it gets uncomfortable. [chuckles]

18:56.593 --> 18:57.594
[music fades]

19:00.848 --> 19:02.015
[indistinct chatter]

19:02.099 --> 19:03.725
[boy 1] Were you sitting
over there before?

19:04.518 --> 19:05.519
[boy 2] Fuck off.

19:08.647 --> 19:12.109
[students] Three, four, five.

19:13.402 --> 19:15.529
-[sighs]
-[Seong-hwan] Everyone, give it a try.

19:15.612 --> 19:16.613
Try it out!

19:17.406 --> 19:21.410
Those thugs beat you up every single day,
so why do you bother to keep showing up?

19:21.910 --> 19:23.579
'Cause it's still school.

19:23.662 --> 19:25.038
[growls softly]

19:25.122 --> 19:26.290
You're a good kid.

19:26.790 --> 19:28.292
-[students] One, two.
-Who are you?

19:29.251 --> 19:30.210
[students] Three.

19:30.294 --> 19:34.131
I'm an ERPB inspector.
And I did a little bit of research on you.

19:34.214 --> 19:37.509
So, want to hear some facts
about Kim Hyeong-ju?

19:37.593 --> 19:38.886
How do you know who I am?

19:39.386 --> 19:42.014
Kid, I just told you. I did some research.

19:42.097 --> 19:43.807
[students laugh]

19:43.891 --> 19:46.602
You should get in there.
Class is starting. [sighs]

19:47.686 --> 19:49.980
Don't worry about a thing.
I'm gonna make sure

19:50.063 --> 19:52.649
that you start learning
despite those guys. All right?

19:52.733 --> 19:54.860
-[boy 3 laughs]
-You can do it, Kim Hyeong-ju.

19:55.861 --> 19:57.738
[students] One, two…

19:58.739 --> 20:01.158
[boy 4] You seriously expected
a receipt for getting mugged?

20:01.241 --> 20:03.035
We have a fucking dumbass here, guys.

20:03.118 --> 20:04.161
[Geun-dae groans]

20:04.244 --> 20:06.330
[boy 4] Comfy? Just stay down there.

20:07.122 --> 20:07.956
Huh?

20:08.040 --> 20:10.042
[boy 5] I saw it, but I just thought…

20:10.125 --> 20:13.128
-One Flew Over the Cuckoo's Nest.
-Hm?

20:13.212 --> 20:15.672
One Flew Over the Cuckoo's Nest.

20:15.756 --> 20:16.840
What is that?

20:16.924 --> 20:18.592
You said you would, um… Remember?

20:18.675 --> 20:21.345
You said you'd go "flutter, flutter,"
when I said, "Cuckoo's Nest!"

20:21.428 --> 20:22.512
It was our code.

20:22.596 --> 20:23.513
Code?

20:26.642 --> 20:29.353
-[Seong-hwan] Hey!
-[students] Oh!

20:29.895 --> 20:32.272
[Geun-dae] I sent you a video
and messaged you the code.

20:32.356 --> 20:33.941
[Hyeong-ju] ♪ Ba-da-ba-ba-ba-bam! ♪

20:34.024 --> 20:35.651
[jaunty music plays]

20:35.734 --> 20:38.528
Oh. Are you Bong Geun-dae,
the deputy director?

20:38.612 --> 20:39.738
Yes, sir.

20:40.322 --> 20:42.908
[Hwa-jin] Okay. I knew I chose
the right person for this job. Wow.

20:42.991 --> 20:44.910
[laughs]

20:47.454 --> 20:48.372
RÉSUMÉ
BONG GEUN-DAE

20:51.708 --> 20:52.709
Hm.

21:00.592 --> 21:01.510
[Hwa-jin] Right.

21:02.010 --> 21:03.971
Look at me. There.

21:04.763 --> 21:07.015
Deputy Director Bong Geun-dae,
can you run?

21:07.099 --> 21:08.934
Uh, why are you taking a…

21:11.603 --> 21:13.689
[indistinct chatter]

21:13.772 --> 21:15.691
Hey! Hey, you shitheads!

21:17.693 --> 21:19.194
[In-beom laughs]

21:20.737 --> 21:21.780
[boy 1] Four Eyes.

21:25.534 --> 21:30.664
Hey, you gangster, punk-ass,
hooligan, idiotic, numbskull shitheads!

21:30.747 --> 21:32.833
[laughs] Yeah, this is for you!

21:32.916 --> 21:36.920
[laughs] You dumb little punks.
Look at what losers you are!

21:37.004 --> 21:39.423
How can you stand living with yourselves?

21:39.506 --> 21:40.382
[laughs]

21:40.465 --> 21:44.094
Whoever catches that fucker
gets 100,000 won. I'm serious. Get him!

21:44.177 --> 21:45.721
Huh? Uh, oh! Oh, no!

21:45.804 --> 21:48.056
[students clamor]

21:48.140 --> 21:49.433
Uh, uh, I'm sorry!

21:49.516 --> 21:50.600
No! No, don't!

21:50.684 --> 21:52.102
All right! I'm not sorry!

21:52.185 --> 21:53.312
[rock music plays]

21:53.395 --> 21:55.772
[yelps] Whoa! Oh!

22:01.320 --> 22:03.322
-[boy 1] Where is he?
-[boy 2] Where'd he go?

22:03.822 --> 22:06.450
[boy 3] Hey! Get the fuck out here,
you stupid fucking coward!

22:06.992 --> 22:09.161
-[boy 4] You scared, fucker?
-[Seong-hwan] Where is he?

22:09.244 --> 22:10.495
[boy 5] You fucking scared?

22:10.579 --> 22:13.415
Hey! I asked you if you were scared,
you chickenshit!

22:13.915 --> 22:16.168
-[boy 6] What the…
-[boy 7] Hey, what the fuck?

22:17.461 --> 22:18.337
Who is that?

22:20.297 --> 22:21.214
[Hwa-jin] Me?

22:22.007 --> 22:24.634
I'm an inspector with
the Educational Rights Protection Bureau.

22:24.718 --> 22:25.844
Educational what? Wh… what…

22:25.927 --> 22:27.929
It's okay. Don't hurt yourself.

22:28.013 --> 22:30.515
He's from that place that
beat up some nerds at Daehan High.

22:30.599 --> 22:33.643
Oh, wow. So Guun High's
not as stupid as it looks.

22:33.727 --> 22:36.104
Someone's paying attention. I approve!

22:36.188 --> 22:39.900
Mister, this isn't the kind of high school
where we care about that shit.

22:39.983 --> 22:41.485
We don't hold back here.

22:41.568 --> 22:44.071
And we don't give a single fuck
whether you're an adult or not.

22:44.154 --> 22:45.864
Wow, that's good to hear.

22:46.573 --> 22:48.533
We're getting to know each other's limits.

22:49.242 --> 22:50.410
Hey, you think I'm joking?

22:50.494 --> 22:51.870
[laughs]

22:52.371 --> 22:55.082
I'm just worried
you boys might get hurt if I go too hard.

22:55.165 --> 22:57.626
All right. Everybody, sit down. Now.

22:57.709 --> 22:59.711
[scoffs] Fuck. Seriously?

22:59.795 --> 23:01.671
What the fuck are you doing, man?

23:01.755 --> 23:02.756
I'm gonna hit him!

23:03.256 --> 23:04.383
You are, huh?

23:04.466 --> 23:07.135
You can't even fight, you lowlife.
What happens if you fuck it up?

23:07.219 --> 23:09.638
The worst that can happen
is they expel me. I don't care.

23:09.721 --> 23:11.598
Life's too short to back down.

23:11.681 --> 23:13.392
Then Gwon-hyeok will finally notice me.

23:13.475 --> 23:17.396
You guys are deluded. Listen up, boys.
No one's quitting school today. Got it?

23:17.479 --> 23:18.939
That's not up to you.

23:19.022 --> 23:21.024
Actually, I'm afraid that it is.

23:21.108 --> 23:24.111
Do you know how much it cost taxpayers
to get you to this level of schooling?

23:24.694 --> 23:27.030
At least 65 million won per person.

23:27.614 --> 23:30.325
You think citizens would be happy
if they knew their precious tax money

23:30.409 --> 23:32.244
was being spent on shits like you guys?

23:32.327 --> 23:34.246
I don't think they'd be happy at all!

23:35.622 --> 23:38.333
So if you want to know
what you can to do to make it up to them,

23:38.417 --> 23:39.459
there are three things.

23:40.335 --> 23:41.461
First of all,

23:42.754 --> 23:46.133
if you wanna leave, you'll pay
every last cent back before you go.

23:46.216 --> 23:47.050
[In-beom scoffs]

23:47.134 --> 23:47.968
[Hwa-jin] Second…

23:48.051 --> 23:48.885
[laughter]

23:48.969 --> 23:51.930
…if you knock me down,
then you can leave freely.

23:52.514 --> 23:54.307
-Third--
-Sir!

23:54.933 --> 23:57.894
I'll do the second one.
That'll be easy. Auto department!

23:57.978 --> 23:58.812
[students cheer]

23:58.895 --> 24:01.731
-Let's go.
-Hey, we're in on this too.

24:01.815 --> 24:03.817
[suspenseful music plays]

24:06.445 --> 24:07.737
Ho-ho.

24:09.322 --> 24:10.907
[grunting]

24:10.991 --> 24:12.701
[rock music plays]

24:13.285 --> 24:15.120
Sit down, you little brats!

24:29.384 --> 24:31.553
[yelps]

24:32.762 --> 24:33.763
[boy 8 yells]

24:34.764 --> 24:37.350
[groans]

24:42.898 --> 24:46.193
Hang on, stay still.
You'll get your eye poked out like that.

24:46.776 --> 24:48.320
-Whoa!
-[yelps]

24:48.403 --> 24:49.696
[boy 9 yells]

24:52.407 --> 24:54.409
I said go! Go now! Go on!

24:54.493 --> 24:56.786
-You punk! Here.
-[groans]

25:00.582 --> 25:01.416
[groans]

25:01.500 --> 25:04.336
-Ah, come on!
-Oh, okay. Feel like getting involved?

25:05.128 --> 25:06.963
-We'll do it together!
-Shit, come on!

25:08.715 --> 25:10.550
[both groan]

25:13.386 --> 25:16.598
Okay, anyone not get hit?
Or anyone want another shot?

25:16.681 --> 25:17.724
-Fuck!
-[Hwa-jin] Huh?

25:17.807 --> 25:18.934
[Seong-hwan grunts] Die!

25:19.434 --> 25:20.477
Die!

25:21.353 --> 25:22.312
[Seong-hwan gasps]

25:22.395 --> 25:23.522
Goddamn it. Take that!

25:25.524 --> 25:26.483
[Seong-hwan groans]

25:26.566 --> 25:27.817
Agh! [groans]

25:27.901 --> 25:29.569
[chokes]

25:30.737 --> 25:31.988
[music fades]

25:32.072 --> 25:33.782
Were you a boxer?

25:34.324 --> 25:36.326
[groans]

25:36.409 --> 25:39.287
[students groan]

25:39.371 --> 25:41.915
Well, that tired me out. Let's sit.

25:41.998 --> 25:44.668
-[yelps]
-[Hwa-jin] Oh. Oh my, oh my, oh my.

25:44.751 --> 25:47.045
This is why you brats
should hear people out. Okay?

25:47.128 --> 25:48.547
So the third and final option,

25:49.214 --> 25:50.966
if you can't manage one or two,

25:51.466 --> 25:54.928
then be grateful
and complete your education.

25:55.011 --> 25:56.304
[students groan]

25:58.473 --> 26:00.475
Come on out now. Hm?

26:02.894 --> 26:05.480
-Wake up is at 6 a.m.
-[boy 9] What?

26:05.564 --> 26:07.190
[Hwa-jin] At 7 a.m., additional lessons.

26:07.274 --> 26:10.277
And afterwards,
you'll have your regular classes.

26:10.360 --> 26:13.863
And after that, you'll have a short break
for lunch, then specialized classes.

26:13.947 --> 26:16.449
Afternoon classes,
afternoon specialty classes,

26:16.533 --> 26:18.827
then your evening supplementary classes.

26:18.910 --> 26:20.370
[jaunty music plays]

26:20.453 --> 26:23.039
Fuck! Why are there
so many damn… [groans] … classes?

26:23.123 --> 26:26.376
You all need to make up for lost time.
You've been skipping too often, guys.

26:27.002 --> 26:28.295
I'm gonna personally make sure

26:28.378 --> 26:31.798
that you punks make up every single
last second of the time you wasted.

26:32.507 --> 26:34.593
I'll make sure
you meet the mandatory class quota

26:34.676 --> 26:36.136
so you can graduate.

26:36.636 --> 26:40.307
What do you say? Isn't
our education system incredible? Yeah?

26:41.766 --> 26:44.227
All right, orientation is over.

26:44.311 --> 26:46.980
Now I'll get your teacher in here,
so stay in your seats.

26:49.733 --> 26:51.067
High five!

26:51.151 --> 26:52.193
[indistinct chatter]

26:52.277 --> 26:53.236
Fucking shit!

26:53.320 --> 26:54.779
Oh! Damn it! [groans]

26:57.115 --> 27:02.287
[both groan]

27:03.079 --> 27:05.165
[indistinct chatter]

27:05.248 --> 27:07.709
-What are you guys looking at?
-[students clamor]

27:11.713 --> 27:14.466
[teacher sighs] Jeez, why are we
having classes in the gym?

27:15.842 --> 27:18.094
-Ah, welcome, sir.
-[teacher] Thank you.

27:19.512 --> 27:20.430
Here.

27:22.474 --> 27:24.017
[coughing, groaning]

27:24.100 --> 27:25.977
[Hwa-jin] Zombies
with a thirst for knowledge.

27:26.478 --> 27:28.647
-[teacher] What?
-[laughs]

27:29.147 --> 27:30.523
Go on in. I'm just joking.

27:31.775 --> 27:33.276
They're quite obedient now.

27:33.360 --> 27:34.736
[music stops]

27:34.819 --> 27:37.614
[teacher] This class has electrical
and automobile department students,

27:37.697 --> 27:41.284
so we're going to learn about
electric cars, which are relevant to both.

27:41.368 --> 27:45.372
-Open your textbooks.
-I haven't got mine. Sir?

27:48.291 --> 27:50.293
You can't have class
without your textbooks.

27:50.377 --> 27:52.045
All right, who's got their book?

27:54.005 --> 27:55.173
[boy 20] My dog ate it.

27:55.256 --> 27:57.425
Hyeong-ju looks like he's got one.

27:58.093 --> 28:00.011
-Want me to go make copies?
-[Seong-hwan exhales]

28:00.095 --> 28:02.305
We're not gonna waste
paper and electricity.

28:02.389 --> 28:06.226
[clears throat] Okay, from this point
forward, you make your own textbooks.

28:07.185 --> 28:09.938
In the Joseon Dynasty way.

28:15.568 --> 28:18.488
Okay. Get ready.
I'm starting the timer now.

28:19.447 --> 28:21.491
Copy down every single word on the board.

28:21.991 --> 28:24.077
[groans] This is terrible.

28:24.703 --> 28:26.413
Ah. I haven't got a pen.

28:26.496 --> 28:29.290
[laughter]

28:29.374 --> 28:31.459
Oh, that is a shame. Hm?

28:31.543 --> 28:34.587
A pen is important.
I wonder what we could use instead?

28:34.671 --> 28:35.630
Hm?

28:36.214 --> 28:38.216
[jaunty music plays]

28:38.925 --> 28:40.385
Of course, there's always your blood.

28:43.471 --> 28:45.098
[operatic music plays]

28:45.181 --> 28:46.725
-[distant screaming]
-[gasps]

28:47.976 --> 28:49.978
[jaunty music resumes]

28:55.567 --> 28:56.484
Hm.

28:57.527 --> 28:59.154
-[winces]
-[Hwa-jin] Good, good.

28:59.654 --> 29:02.365
Now then, raise your hand
if you also don't have a pen.

29:03.199 --> 29:04.200
Anyone?

29:06.619 --> 29:10.039
-Hey, do you two not have pens?
-[timer beeps]

29:10.123 --> 29:11.374
[boy 10 groans]

29:13.293 --> 29:16.379
-[boy 11] Wait, wait, wait! No, no!
-[students moan]

29:16.463 --> 29:18.006
Shit! Come on!

29:19.048 --> 29:20.258
I told you I was timing it.

29:20.341 --> 29:22.510
Come to the front
if you couldn't copy it down.

29:22.594 --> 29:23.928
[groans]

29:24.012 --> 29:25.847
-[yelps]
-[students] Oh!

29:25.930 --> 29:27.307
-[groans]
-You want a double?

29:28.266 --> 29:29.517
[groans]

29:30.435 --> 29:32.353
Stand up straight.
I haven't even touched you.

29:32.437 --> 29:33.480
[groans]

29:33.563 --> 29:34.647
-[Hwa-jin] Okay.
-[groans]

29:34.731 --> 29:36.357
[boy 3] Oh, ho-ho!

29:36.441 --> 29:37.650
[boy 4] He did it too.

29:41.279 --> 29:43.239
[breathes deeply]

29:51.289 --> 29:53.124
[screams]

29:53.208 --> 29:54.292
[Seong-hwan] Fuck!

29:54.375 --> 29:56.628
[yells] Shit!

29:57.128 --> 29:58.922
[gasps] Fuck all this shit!

29:59.005 --> 30:01.090
I don't have to take
this fucking class anyway.

30:01.174 --> 30:02.926
Just let everyone go now!

30:03.009 --> 30:05.637
The fuckers who want to take it
can stay and finish.

30:05.720 --> 30:08.932
Why are we being forced to take the class
when we don't even want to?

30:09.015 --> 30:11.643
This isn't gonna help our lives at all!

30:13.311 --> 30:15.772
Okay. You've made a very good point.

30:16.856 --> 30:20.318
So we'll just focus on classes that will
be helpful to your lives from now on.

30:20.401 --> 30:23.822
[teacher] All right, if you suspect
that there's a problem with the brakes,

30:23.905 --> 30:25.573
there are four things you need to check.

30:25.657 --> 30:26.616
Smell my finger.

30:26.699 --> 30:30.870
We need to determine if it's an electrical
or a mechanical issue before we start.

30:30.954 --> 30:33.998
So I'd like the electrical department
to take a close look…

30:34.082 --> 30:35.333
You're such a stupid punk.

30:35.416 --> 30:38.753
Automobile guys can check the brake pads
and brake fluid levels.

30:39.337 --> 30:41.047
-Yes, sir.
-Okay. Yeah.

30:41.130 --> 30:43.132
-[boy 1] Yeah, yeah.
-I know you were all listening.

30:43.883 --> 30:47.220
Okay, great. Park Seong-hwan, Cho In-beom,
come here and fix the brakes.

30:47.303 --> 30:50.265
-What? What the fuck are you saying now?
-Oh, we won't be able to.

30:50.348 --> 30:51.432
You don't think you can?

30:51.516 --> 30:53.101
Yeah. That's fucking stating the obvious!

30:53.184 --> 30:56.688
Man, you sure say "fuck" a lot. [chuckles]

30:56.771 --> 30:59.482
[students] Whoa, who, whoa!
Whoa, whoa, whoa!

30:59.566 --> 31:01.651
-[boy 2] Take it easy. Easy!
-[students mutter]

31:01.734 --> 31:03.403
-You want a punch?
-Uh, I'll go. I'm going!

31:03.486 --> 31:05.947
-[boy 3] What's he gonna do?
-Why are you always so violent?

31:06.990 --> 31:09.033
You guys should be
filming this, goddamn it.

31:09.117 --> 31:10.159
Aw, shit, man.

31:10.243 --> 31:12.620
[indistinct yelling]

31:12.704 --> 31:13.830
[engine revs]

31:14.789 --> 31:17.083
[students yell]

31:17.166 --> 31:18.960
-Oh!
-Oh! Whoa!

31:19.043 --> 31:21.170
Whoa! [yelps] Whoa!

31:21.254 --> 31:22.422
[brakes squeal]

31:22.505 --> 31:24.257
[rock music plays]

31:24.340 --> 31:25.592
-[In-beom] Brake!
-[screams]

31:25.675 --> 31:27.218
-[In-beom] Brake!
-[tires squeal]

31:28.136 --> 31:29.971
Agh, the brakes don't work!

31:31.139 --> 31:33.975
[Seong-hwan and In-beom scream]

31:37.020 --> 31:39.230
-Someone help!
-We're gonna die!

31:40.273 --> 31:41.107
[both scream]

31:43.568 --> 31:46.321
[gasps] These brakes don't work, remember?

31:46.404 --> 31:48.072
-[Seong-hwan screams]
-[In-beom] Wait!

31:48.156 --> 31:50.366
You were both in class, right?
And I told you to fix them?

31:50.450 --> 31:51.659
[In-beom yelps]

31:51.743 --> 31:52.869
-Up ahead, up ahead!
-[yelps]

31:52.952 --> 31:56.789
-What's up ahead?
-If you keep going, we'll all die!

31:56.873 --> 32:00.126
[Seong-hwan and In-beom scream]

32:05.048 --> 32:06.925
[screams]

32:09.010 --> 32:10.178
[yelps]

32:11.596 --> 32:14.349
[students clamor]

32:14.432 --> 32:15.475
Whoa!

32:16.643 --> 32:18.269
[indistinct chatter]

32:18.353 --> 32:19.270
[tires screech]

32:20.313 --> 32:23.441
[screams]

32:24.484 --> 32:26.986
[both scream]

32:30.406 --> 32:31.532
[screams]

32:32.742 --> 32:35.078
All right, this is it, this is it!
Here we go!

32:35.161 --> 32:36.287
Oh, fuck!

32:37.288 --> 32:39.207
[students scream]

32:39.290 --> 32:40.708
[both scream]

32:41.459 --> 32:42.335
-[screams]
-[whimpers]

32:43.628 --> 32:45.296
[sobs]

32:46.339 --> 32:47.924
Holy shit balls!

32:48.549 --> 32:51.511
[both panting]

32:51.594 --> 32:54.222
[indistinct chatter]

32:59.602 --> 33:01.437
[both breathe shakily]

33:02.855 --> 33:06.150
You don't get to decide
whether a class is necessary or not.

33:06.985 --> 33:09.028
There's no such thing
as an unnecessary class.

33:10.154 --> 33:11.030
Huh.

33:11.698 --> 33:13.992
[cheering]

33:16.160 --> 33:17.954
Oh, those motherfuckers.

33:18.705 --> 33:19.872
Oh. Thanks.

33:20.957 --> 33:23.042
[cheering]

33:27.005 --> 33:27.964
What the…

33:28.047 --> 33:31.843
[man] I looked into that Bureau inspector,
and it's really quite odd.

33:31.926 --> 33:36.014
In his "career details" section,
the only word is "classified."

33:36.097 --> 33:37.724
I made a formal request
for these documents

33:37.807 --> 33:39.726
from the National Assembly
Intelligence Committee.

33:39.809 --> 33:41.102
It feels like we're in a movie.

33:41.894 --> 33:45.773
Sir, you were the director of
the National Intelligence Service, right?

33:45.857 --> 33:48.860
I just thought
that there might be a way for you to

33:49.360 --> 33:51.237
get a little more information on him.

33:52.363 --> 33:58.119
KOREA ARMY SPECIAL WARFARE COMMAND
CERTIFICATE OF MILITARY RECORD

33:58.202 --> 34:00.204
[Hyeong-ju] First,
open the brake fluid reservoir,

34:00.288 --> 34:03.750
drain it, fill it with new fluid, and then
you can go ahead and check the levels.

34:03.833 --> 34:07.795
At this point, you also have to check
if there's any air in the braking system.

34:07.879 --> 34:11.883
Hey, fucking loser! Who the hell
do you think you are, teaching us?

34:11.966 --> 34:15.136
You think you can do whatever you want
because your status has improved?

34:15.219 --> 34:17.221
You loser. I wish I could-- [yelps]

34:20.808 --> 34:22.268
You don't seem to learn your lesson.

34:23.895 --> 34:25.396
You'll learn through experience, then.

34:26.022 --> 34:27.440
-[sputters]
-Sir, I…

34:27.982 --> 34:31.611
I was being a bit annoying.
These guys won't do it again. Right?

34:31.694 --> 34:33.780
-Sure.
-Yeah.

34:35.406 --> 34:38.034
[Geun-dae] Why did you
defend those guys earlier?

34:38.534 --> 34:40.787
I was worried
that if something else went wrong,

34:40.870 --> 34:43.456
we'd have to stop
the lessons we're finally getting.

34:43.539 --> 34:47.251
Every single second
is pretty much crucial to me.

34:48.169 --> 34:49.712
[gentle music plays]

34:49.796 --> 34:52.673
You were the one who got the inspector
to stop them, weren't you?

34:53.174 --> 34:54.133
Thank you.

34:55.218 --> 34:57.887
It's nothing. Just doing my job.

34:59.347 --> 35:00.264
[sighs]

35:00.348 --> 35:02.350
[chain jangles]

35:08.314 --> 35:09.524
[music fades]

35:09.607 --> 35:12.652
[In-beom] We're fucked if we don't
make the interview with Gwon-hyeok today,

35:12.735 --> 35:13.778
so use all your strength.

35:13.861 --> 35:16.781
-[strains]
-Oh, yeah, yeah. I think it moved a bit.

35:16.864 --> 35:18.491
-It didn't. Shit!
-I think it's working!

35:18.574 --> 35:20.701
It's not fucking working, dude. Shut up.

35:20.785 --> 35:22.453
-[toilet flushes]
-[In-beom yelps]

35:24.288 --> 35:26.207
-Fucking shit.
-Oh!

35:26.290 --> 35:29.001
Hey, transfer student,
come here, you fucker. Huh?

35:29.085 --> 35:32.505
I know you're a little fucker, transfer
student. You got any fucking cigarettes?

35:32.588 --> 35:34.715
-Ah, come on, let him go.
-Hey, he does!

35:34.799 --> 35:37.385
So this little fucker vapes. Oh shit!

35:37.468 --> 35:40.721
Whoa, you're a little savage.
Look. A utility knife.

35:42.348 --> 35:43.724
-Give me that.
-You little shit.

35:43.808 --> 35:44.851
Oh, uh, why?

35:44.934 --> 35:48.354
-[Seong-hwan] Shit, this actually works.
-Yeah, I told you it would.

35:48.437 --> 35:51.607
Okay, this is the last one.
Stop moving. Stay still, fucker.

35:51.691 --> 35:54.110
-[Seong-hwan] Almost got it.
-[In-beom] Yeah. I'm done.

35:54.193 --> 35:56.237
-Fucking right!
-[In-beom] Shit! It fucking worked.

35:56.320 --> 35:57.405
Here. Hold this.

35:57.488 --> 35:58.447
-Okay.
-[In-beom] Got it.

35:58.531 --> 36:00.825
You're gonna go first, and then you'll go.

36:01.409 --> 36:02.410
Wh… why do I have to go?

36:02.493 --> 36:04.954
'Cause if you don't,
you're gonna snitch on us.

36:05.037 --> 36:06.414
[In-beom strains]

36:06.497 --> 36:08.624
[man 1] Hey, you made it.
Good luck in there.

36:08.708 --> 36:11.169
-[Gwon-hyeok] This is the last time.
-[man 2] Thank you, sir!

36:11.252 --> 36:13.254
[dance music plays]

36:13.838 --> 36:16.966
[Seong-hwan] Wow. Holy fuck.
He's so fucking cool.

36:17.675 --> 36:19.093
-[Gwon-hyeok] Dig deeper.
-Be cool.

36:19.177 --> 36:20.303
[man 3] Understood, sir.

36:22.597 --> 36:24.599
Fuck, he's calling us!
He's calling us over. Shit!

36:24.682 --> 36:27.101
-Come on, loser, hurry up, let's go!
-I can't! [whimpers]

36:29.812 --> 36:30.688
[both] Two, three…

36:30.771 --> 36:32.440
Thank you for having us, sir!

36:32.523 --> 36:33.816
Cho In-beom from electrical.

36:33.900 --> 36:36.110
Park Seong-hwan, from Guun High,
18 years old.

36:36.903 --> 36:39.322
-Tell him your name, fucker.
-Uh… I'm Bong Geun-dae, sir.

36:39.405 --> 36:41.115
[both] We're very pleased
to meet you, sir.

36:44.452 --> 36:47.705
-I thought I only invited you here.
-There was an issue with the school, sir.

36:52.501 --> 36:53.878
[indistinct whispering]

36:55.963 --> 36:57.590
[man 4] Let's roll! Yeah!

36:57.673 --> 36:58.883
[scoffs]

36:58.966 --> 37:00.801
[cheering]

37:03.012 --> 37:06.766
We're all here now,
so let's have a drink. Let's go!

37:07.892 --> 37:10.478
-Hey. Come and get a picture with us.
-[In-beom] Yes, sir!

37:10.561 --> 37:14.607
[shouting]

37:15.274 --> 37:17.193
[boy 1] Hey, look! He's here.

37:17.276 --> 37:18.110
STUDY HALL

37:18.194 --> 37:24.867
[Hwa-jin] ♪ La, la, la
Super fun times in study hall ♪

37:24.951 --> 37:28.120
Hey. Where are Park Seong-hwan,
Cho In-beom

37:28.704 --> 37:29.956
and Bong Geun-dae?

37:30.831 --> 37:32.458
[In-beom] We're right here, sir.

37:34.043 --> 37:35.002
[Geun-dae whimpers]

37:37.588 --> 37:38.422
Oh, sorry, sir.

37:38.506 --> 37:41.550
What are you doing, you punks?
Look at your sorry selves.

37:41.634 --> 37:45.096
I told you to study separately.
Bong Geun-dae! Are you also a punk?

37:45.179 --> 37:46.430
Oh! No, I'm not!

37:46.514 --> 37:49.016
-[Seong-hwan] Shh.
-Hey, sir. You're totally screwed.

37:49.100 --> 37:51.686
You know, you might
wanna start begging. [chuckles]

37:52.270 --> 37:53.104
[laughs]

37:53.187 --> 37:54.188
[laughs]

37:54.272 --> 37:55.564
[chuckles]

37:55.648 --> 37:56.857
[all three laugh]

37:56.941 --> 37:59.527
Why, what's going on?
Did you bring some backup punks?

37:59.610 --> 38:01.320
-Outside.
-[students murmur]

38:01.404 --> 38:03.030
Gwon-hyeok. Gwon-hyeok!

38:04.407 --> 38:07.326
[students cheer]

38:12.415 --> 38:14.083
Oh! Gwon-hyeok! Gwon-hyeok!

38:18.045 --> 38:19.046
These little punks.

38:19.130 --> 38:20.881
[cheering continues]

38:24.051 --> 38:26.554
-Oh, yeah! Welcome, sir!
-[boy 2] Yeah!

38:26.637 --> 38:28.556
-[boy 3] Oh yeah!
-[boy 4] Yeah!

38:29.056 --> 38:30.933
-[coughs]
-[boy 5] That's an entrance.

38:31.017 --> 38:32.643
[laughter]

38:34.145 --> 38:36.105
-[boy 6] Whoa.
-[boy 7] Welcome, sir!

38:36.188 --> 38:38.816
-[boy 8] Nice to see you, sir!
-Hello, sir! Welcome!

38:38.899 --> 38:41.610
[chuckles] Well, well. [scoffs]

38:41.694 --> 38:42.778
[boy 2] I'm telling ya.

38:43.821 --> 38:46.157
Look at that cigarette. Unfiltered, huh?

38:46.657 --> 38:48.701
What should I do with you? Hm?

38:49.410 --> 38:51.329
You must've gotten the lowdown
on the way here

38:51.412 --> 38:55.458
that there's a scary man who beats up
disruptive students, huh? [chuckles]

38:55.541 --> 38:56.917
[chuckles]

38:58.419 --> 39:01.297
You're not that scary, you know.
Except I'm pretty scary.

39:01.380 --> 39:03.132
-[students murmur]
-[Hwa-jin] Oh, really?

39:03.215 --> 39:06.218
That's true. You are
a high-school gangster after all.

39:06.302 --> 39:08.763
So let's see how strong you are.
Think I'll break a sweat?

39:08.846 --> 39:10.264
[scoffs]

39:12.141 --> 39:14.352
Oh, you little shithead.

39:15.311 --> 39:16.979
-[Gwon-hyeok grunts]
-[students] Whoa!

39:19.190 --> 39:20.441
-Oh!
-Oh!

39:24.445 --> 39:25.279
[grunts]

39:25.363 --> 39:27.490
[suspenseful music plays]

39:27.573 --> 39:28.699
[Hwa-jin] Oh?

39:28.783 --> 39:29.825
[Gwon-hyeok grunts]

39:32.703 --> 39:33.704
[Hwa-jin chuckles]

39:35.539 --> 39:36.832
[Gwon-hyeok groans]

39:36.916 --> 39:38.501
-[Hwa-jin] Ah!
-[students] Oh!

39:38.584 --> 39:40.086
-Oh!
-[Seong-hwan] Shit. Damn!

39:40.169 --> 39:41.128
[Gwon-hyeok grunts]

39:41.212 --> 39:42.671
[students cheer]

39:43.381 --> 39:44.924
[boy 3] Yes!

39:45.007 --> 39:46.425
Whoo!

39:46.509 --> 39:47.760
[strains]

39:52.431 --> 39:53.766
[Gwon-hyeok grunts]

39:53.849 --> 39:55.351
-Whoa!
-[cheering]

39:55.434 --> 39:56.894
-Whoa!
-Oh!

39:58.729 --> 40:00.815
[In-beom] That was incredible, sir!

40:01.565 --> 40:03.192
I knew we could count on you, Gwon-hyeok.

40:03.275 --> 40:04.652
[cheering]

40:04.735 --> 40:07.113
[Seong-hwan] Hey, louder! Make some noise!

40:07.196 --> 40:08.906
[In-beom] I knew
you'd come through for us.

40:08.989 --> 40:12.868
-[students] Gwon-hyeok! Gwon-hyeok!
-Shh. Shh. Shh. Shh.

40:13.911 --> 40:16.455
-Listen up, you fuckers!
-[laughter]

40:16.539 --> 40:17.623
From now on,

40:18.124 --> 40:21.252
I will not let anyone get beaten up
by kids from other schools like that!

40:21.836 --> 40:25.714
And I won't let shitty old farts
like this guy beat up any students.

40:26.215 --> 40:28.342
-If you're in trouble, drop my name!
-[boy 9] Yeah!

40:28.426 --> 40:32.054
And if they keep trying to fight you even
after you say it, I'll fucking end 'em!

40:32.138 --> 40:34.765
-Whoo!
-[students cheer]

40:34.849 --> 40:39.812
[students] Gwon-hyeok! Gwon-hyeok!
Gwon-hyeok! Gwon-hyeok! Gwon-hyeok!

40:39.895 --> 40:43.149
[Hwa-jin] Gwon-hyeok!
Gwon-hyeok! Gwon-hyeok! Gwon-hyeok!

40:43.232 --> 40:46.944
Gwon-hyeok! Gwon-hyeok!
Gwon-hyeok! Gwon-hyeok!

40:47.027 --> 40:51.699
Gwon-hyeok! Gwon-hyeok!
Gwon-hyeok! Gwon-hyeok! Why'd you stop?

40:51.782 --> 40:53.701
He said to drop his name, so drop it.

40:53.784 --> 40:57.121
Jang Gwon-hyeok! [laughs]

40:57.204 --> 40:58.539
Hey!

40:58.622 --> 41:01.208
What the hell? Jang Gwon-hyeok.

41:01.709 --> 41:03.127
What does your name mean?

41:03.210 --> 41:06.088
Is it like a free pass?
Like a backstage pass or something?

41:06.172 --> 41:07.089
[students murmur]

41:07.173 --> 41:09.467
Look, guys, this is exactly why

41:09.550 --> 41:11.677
it's so important
to complete your studies.

41:11.760 --> 41:14.638
You might be physically big,
but your mind is tiny like a child's.

41:15.306 --> 41:16.432
Jang Gwon-hyeok.

41:16.515 --> 41:18.684
Do you know why I dragged you down here?

41:19.268 --> 41:21.854
I wanted you to be my demonstration tool.

41:21.937 --> 41:23.981
-[students mutter]
-[Seong-hwan] He's such a downer.

41:24.482 --> 41:26.233
[principal] You want
to bring in Gwon-hyeok?

41:26.317 --> 41:27.860
[intriguing music plays]

41:27.943 --> 41:30.946
You need to pull out the root
to make sure no more weeds grow.

41:31.030 --> 41:33.407
How exactly do you plan
on luring him there?

41:33.491 --> 41:36.076
These guys all think
that their bro has their backs.

41:37.411 --> 41:39.663
So they're bound to call on him
when they get beaten up.

41:42.124 --> 41:42.958
You shitty f--

41:46.504 --> 41:47.421
Ooh!

41:47.505 --> 41:50.674
You clearly didn't understand me,
so that gets you a flick, you brat.

41:52.551 --> 41:55.721
-[students] Oh!
-Oh!

41:55.804 --> 41:57.723
Oh, wow!

41:57.806 --> 41:59.808
[breathes shakily]

41:59.892 --> 42:02.019
[Hwa-jin] You okay? Hm?

42:03.687 --> 42:04.647
[chuckles]

42:05.314 --> 42:08.192
You are so fucked now. [laughs]

42:08.275 --> 42:09.527
I called my men.

42:10.069 --> 42:12.154
-[Hwa-jin] Mm.
-They're coming to support me.

42:12.238 --> 42:14.073
-[Gwon-hyeok chuckles]
-Oh no.

42:14.156 --> 42:17.993
Still haven't figured it out yet, huh?
I'm here to support you, too, kiddo.

42:18.077 --> 42:19.161
With this.

42:21.288 --> 42:22.289
[music stops]

42:24.124 --> 42:27.253
[Gi-tae] Inspector Na Hwa-jin
had quite the illustrious career.

42:27.336 --> 42:30.881
Apparently, he was a captain
in the Special Forces Elite Mission Unit.

42:30.965 --> 42:33.342
Do you want to bring us back
to the days of training schools

42:33.425 --> 42:35.219
under military dictatorship?

42:35.970 --> 42:38.889
Do you want students to be oppressed
under the heel of military boots?

42:39.473 --> 42:40.391
I certainly don't.

42:40.474 --> 42:41.725
[tense music plays]

42:41.809 --> 42:45.980
Our party intends to focus all
of its energies into disbanding the ERPB.

42:46.063 --> 42:48.357
We feel the Bureau is an organization
that shouldn't exist.

42:48.440 --> 42:50.234
What exactly is the problem?

42:51.318 --> 42:54.029
Is it a problem that the inspector
is a former soldier?

42:54.113 --> 42:58.158
The level of student violence we're seeing
now is far greater than usual.

42:58.242 --> 43:01.328
Students are active gangsters
while still in school,

43:01.829 --> 43:04.456
in gangs that have been
formed by students.

43:05.165 --> 43:06.292
Violence is higher than ever,

43:06.375 --> 43:08.877
yet you expect teachers
to fight back with nothing but chalk?

43:09.670 --> 43:11.714
The Bureau's intention
isn't to fight the students.

43:11.797 --> 43:14.758
It's to fight the monsters
who threaten fellow students.

43:17.094 --> 43:18.304
And a monster

43:19.597 --> 43:22.141
can only be taken down by another monster.

43:24.518 --> 43:25.394
[music fades]

43:26.228 --> 43:28.105
[thunder crashes]

43:28.939 --> 43:30.316
[indistinct chatter]

43:30.399 --> 43:31.817
Stop now!

43:31.900 --> 43:32.776
Ooh. Oh!

43:35.779 --> 43:37.865
[chains rattle]

43:39.199 --> 43:40.075
Are these your men?

43:40.826 --> 43:42.036
-Oh!
-[thug 1] Hey!

43:42.786 --> 43:44.872
You've really made a mess
around here, haven't you?

43:44.955 --> 43:46.415
[sniffs] Now look!

43:47.082 --> 43:49.585
Are any of you students?
Let me see a show of hands.

43:49.668 --> 43:52.421
[laughter]

43:52.504 --> 43:54.840
No one? Well, that's a relief.

43:54.923 --> 43:57.426
If you're not students,
I don't have to go easy on you.

43:57.509 --> 44:00.304
Hey, how'd you get all the way over there?
Go on, then.

44:01.138 --> 44:02.431
Yeah, keep going.

44:04.433 --> 44:06.560
I don't have to go easy
on him though, do I?

44:07.061 --> 44:08.604
Wow, look at you.

44:08.687 --> 44:10.689
So tough, trying to scare me.

44:12.775 --> 44:15.527
Listen up, because I'm only gonna
tell you this once.

44:16.528 --> 44:19.198
A school is a place
where lessons are learned.

44:19.281 --> 44:20.824
[In-beom] You're gonna get us caught.

44:21.408 --> 44:25.162
Nobody is allowed inside unless they're
learning a lesson or teaching a lesson.

44:26.163 --> 44:29.291
The moment one of you
takes a single step forward…

44:31.669 --> 44:34.546
is the moment that you and I go to war.

44:35.130 --> 44:35.964
War?

44:36.048 --> 44:37.633
You're lucky that's our specialty.

44:39.510 --> 44:41.679
[thugs clamor]

44:41.762 --> 44:43.681
[rock music plays]

44:45.432 --> 44:46.934
[thunder crashes]

44:48.477 --> 44:49.353
[thugs yell]

44:51.647 --> 44:53.190
♪ I'm gonna hunt you down ♪

44:54.233 --> 44:55.818
♪ Yeah, I ain't playing around ♪

44:56.985 --> 44:58.445
♪ I'mma take your crown ♪

44:58.529 --> 45:01.115
♪ Man, better run, gonna hunt you down… ♪

45:02.574 --> 45:04.576
-[thug 2 screams]
-[onlookers gasp]

45:04.660 --> 45:06.495
♪ I ain't playing around ♪

45:07.705 --> 45:09.081
♪ I'mma take your crown ♪

45:09.164 --> 45:12.042
♪ Man, better run, gonna hunt you down ♪

45:12.126 --> 45:14.420
♪ Yeah, I be coming at you like Hannibal ♪

45:14.503 --> 45:17.297
♪ Uh, I'm a killer, call me a cannibal… ♪

45:17.798 --> 45:18.799
[Hwa-jin yells]

45:20.092 --> 45:22.177
♪ Man, better run, gonna hunt you down ♪

45:24.012 --> 45:24.888
[thug 3 screams]

45:26.056 --> 45:27.516
-[bones crack]
-[thug 4 groans]

45:30.978 --> 45:32.312
-[knife slices]
-[thug 5 groans]

45:36.859 --> 45:39.403
-♪ Yeah, I ain't playing around ♪
-♪ I ain't playing around ♪

45:39.486 --> 45:41.238
♪ I'mma take your crown ♪

45:41.321 --> 45:43.532
♪ Man, better run, gonna hunt you down… ♪

45:43.615 --> 45:45.951
[groans]

45:47.453 --> 45:49.747
-♪ I'm gonna hunt you down ♪
-♪ Gonna hunt you ♪

45:49.830 --> 45:52.708
-♪ Yeah, I ain't playing around ♪
-♪ I ain't playing around ♪

45:52.791 --> 45:54.334
♪ I'mma take your crown ♪

45:54.418 --> 45:57.045
♪ Man, better run, gonna hunt you down ♪

45:57.546 --> 45:59.882
♪ Yeah, I be coming for you
Like Hannibal ♪

45:59.965 --> 46:02.634
♪ Uh, I'm a killer, call me a cannibal ♪

46:02.718 --> 46:05.053
♪ Uh, I'mma take your crown ♪

46:05.137 --> 46:07.806
♪ Man better run, gonna hunt you down ♪

46:16.565 --> 46:17.524
[music stops]

46:19.651 --> 46:20.819
[thugs groan]

46:20.903 --> 46:22.488
[Seong-hwan] Wh… what the hell?

46:23.781 --> 46:25.657
Oh! [whimpers]

46:25.741 --> 46:29.244
Sir, I was wrong, okay?
Please spare me, sir!

46:29.328 --> 46:31.246
Sir, I was also wrong! [whimpers]

46:31.330 --> 46:32.372
That isn't it.

46:33.957 --> 46:36.043
[whimpers] Oh, uh…

46:36.543 --> 46:39.213
Then I'll… I'll stop coming to school!

46:39.296 --> 46:40.798
-[whimpers]
-I'll drop out!

46:40.881 --> 46:42.466
That's not it either.

46:43.342 --> 46:46.053
[whimpers]

46:47.763 --> 46:48.806
Think about it.

46:49.723 --> 46:51.892
Who is it
that you should be apologizing to?

46:52.392 --> 46:55.771
[both whimper]

46:57.147 --> 46:58.190
Oh!

46:59.358 --> 47:01.777
-Oh!
-[Seong-hwan] Oh, right! Hey, hey!

47:01.860 --> 47:03.779
Hyeong-ju! Hey, Hyeong-ju!

47:03.862 --> 47:06.949
I'm sorry! Oh, please. Forgive me, please!

47:07.032 --> 47:09.326
-I'm so sorry!
-I'm so sorry!

47:09.409 --> 47:12.371
Hey, please forgive me!
Please spare me, man. Please!

47:12.454 --> 47:15.123
Uh, it's… it's… it's okay, guys.
It's okay, really.

47:15.207 --> 47:16.542
[In-beom] Oh please! [cries]

47:16.625 --> 47:17.751
You don't have to do that.

47:17.835 --> 47:20.337
[Seong-hwan] No, really,
please forgive me. I'm really sorry.

47:20.420 --> 47:22.506
[Seong-hwan sobs]

47:27.469 --> 47:28.428
Hyeong-ju.

47:28.512 --> 47:29.346
[Seong-hwan] Please!

47:29.429 --> 47:30.848
[sobbing continues]

47:32.432 --> 47:33.725
You sure you're okay?

47:43.944 --> 47:45.863
[cries]

47:50.284 --> 47:52.286
[poignant music plays]

47:57.749 --> 48:00.210
[Seong-hwan] I'm sorry. [cries]

48:05.215 --> 48:07.968
[cries]

48:10.470 --> 48:14.099
[sobs]

48:18.896 --> 48:21.440
[both cry]

48:26.820 --> 48:28.488
-[Seong-hwan whimpers]
-[In-beom sniffles]

48:33.201 --> 48:35.162
[Hwa-jin] If you don't want
to take classes, don't.

48:35.245 --> 48:37.581
If you don't want to study, don't.
It's your life.

48:38.290 --> 48:39.207
However…

48:41.877 --> 48:44.463
don't get in the way
of anyone else's life.

48:46.048 --> 48:49.927
Don't assume that a minute of your life
is the same as anyone else's.

48:50.928 --> 48:52.512
Even if it may seem like it.

48:58.560 --> 49:01.480
That knowledge will make
a world of difference in your life.

49:12.199 --> 49:15.619
-Understand, you brats?
-Yes! [whimpers]

49:15.702 --> 49:17.371
Speak up. Do you understand or not?

49:17.454 --> 49:18.580
[students] Yes, sir!

49:23.543 --> 49:24.586
[clicks tongue]

49:25.587 --> 49:26.922
[sirens wail]

49:27.547 --> 49:28.548
[chuckles]

49:33.136 --> 49:37.224
[Gang-seok] I will now give a report
on the recent endeavors of the ERPB.

49:37.307 --> 49:40.477
Through the diligent work
of Inspector Na Hwa-jin,

49:40.560 --> 49:43.897
the Bureau has resolved the issues
around the right to learn at Guun Tech.

49:43.981 --> 49:46.900
In order to prevent those issues
from recurring anywhere else,

49:46.984 --> 49:49.861
we will be contacting departments
to implement the following.

49:49.945 --> 49:50.821
TATTOO REMOVAL CLINIC

49:50.904 --> 49:54.241
Starting now, all tattoos will be banned
at all schools.

49:54.324 --> 49:55.200
[student groans]

49:55.283 --> 49:57.369
[man] You're gonna do more damage
if you keep moving.

49:57.995 --> 50:01.123
[Gang-seok] Motorcycles will no longer
be permitted on school grounds.

50:01.206 --> 50:02.374
NO SMOKING ON CAMPUS

50:02.457 --> 50:05.544
YOU'LL BE A GREAT MECHANIC
YOUR FRIEND, GEUN-DAE

50:05.627 --> 50:08.130
[uplifting music plays]

50:11.299 --> 50:14.803
[Gang-seok] If any student attempts
to start or join an organized crime group,

50:14.886 --> 50:17.514
like a gang of school bullies
or a gang of violent criminals,

50:17.597 --> 50:21.935
they will be charged and tried as adults
under the laws against organized crime.

50:22.602 --> 50:24.813
Finally, in cooperation
with the Ministry of Justice

50:24.896 --> 50:27.441
and the Ministry
of Sciences and Technology,

50:27.524 --> 50:31.820
we plan on monitoring and deterring
any Millennial and Gen Z gangsters,

50:31.903 --> 50:33.447
who recruit through social media.

50:33.530 --> 50:35.407
We at the ERPB

50:35.991 --> 50:39.828
will continue to do our utmost to protect
our students' educational rights.

50:39.911 --> 50:41.705
-TV off!
-[Geun-dae] Oh, yes, sir!

50:41.788 --> 50:42.956
[Hwa-jin] Whoa!

50:43.040 --> 50:47.294
You were just in there, and now
you've appeared in here. [laughs]

50:47.377 --> 50:50.714
I don't mean to overstep, but are you
trying to become a television personality?

50:50.797 --> 50:52.841
What? You do it, then.

50:52.924 --> 50:55.469
I didn't mean it like that.
You seem to be enjoying it, that's all.

50:55.552 --> 50:56.803
Am I not allowed to enjoy it?

50:56.887 --> 50:59.097
Of course you are! Did you watch him?

50:59.181 --> 51:02.225
"The Educational Rights Protection Bureau
will do the utmost to protect--"

51:02.309 --> 51:04.895
-Come on.
-[Hwa-jin] That was the best! [laughs]

51:04.978 --> 51:08.899
Uh, may I interrupt your conversation
for a moment, please?

51:08.982 --> 51:09.858
[Gang-seok] Of course.

51:09.941 --> 51:13.945
Well, I had a few incidental expenses
on this project that were out of pocket.

51:14.029 --> 51:17.532
Oh, well, of course you should claim
those expenses. What are they?

51:17.616 --> 51:22.329
Well, uh, on three separate occasions,
I was shaken down.

51:22.412 --> 51:23.955
Oh, you were? Right.

51:24.623 --> 51:26.458
Uh, it was 40,000 won in cash

51:26.541 --> 51:29.294
and 500 from a vending machine
that sold fancy coffees,

51:29.377 --> 51:31.088
and then, in front
of the labs at the school,

51:31.171 --> 51:35.884
they took my Nike Air Force shoes,
worth, uh, 125,000 won.

51:35.967 --> 51:38.595
-They were nice and white and new.
-Mm.

51:38.678 --> 51:41.973
I had also been microwaving
an Uiseong Garlic Sausage sandwich,

51:42.057 --> 51:44.935
which was 2,200 won
at the concession stand.

51:45.018 --> 51:46.103
[jaunty music plays]

51:46.186 --> 51:48.188
They even took that away from me.

51:48.814 --> 51:50.148
After calculating everything,

51:50.232 --> 51:53.944
the total was about 167,000 won
out of pocket.

51:54.027 --> 51:57.197
So, would I be able to claim that?

51:57.864 --> 51:58.824
Oh, sure.

51:59.574 --> 52:01.451
But did they steal anything else?

52:01.535 --> 52:03.662
Oh, uh…

52:03.745 --> 52:05.247
MEDICAL BILLS…

52:05.330 --> 52:06.832
No, that was all of it.

52:08.083 --> 52:10.210
All right. Claim the expenses.

52:10.794 --> 52:11.920
[Geun-dae] Thank you, sir.

52:15.799 --> 52:17.300
Want me to buy you a sausage?

52:18.176 --> 52:20.929
Huh? Oh, no, no. No, I'm fine, sir.

52:21.012 --> 52:23.056
That Uiseong Garlic thing
sounds really good.

52:23.807 --> 52:26.351
-You should have one.
-Hey, lay off.

52:26.434 --> 52:29.354
-I thought… You just said he was robbed.
-[Gang-seok] Enough.

52:30.689 --> 52:31.773
[music stops]

52:39.447 --> 52:40.448
[inhales]

52:44.452 --> 52:45.287
[sighs]

53:12.355 --> 53:13.773
[exhales]

53:34.211 --> 53:35.962
[poignant music plays]

54:05.867 --> 54:08.286
[haunting ballad plays]

55:18.356 --> 55:19.441
[music fades]
